accelerating repurchases by monitoring TSX and SEC filings through platforms like TMX Money or Edger.

00:01:56.740 --> 00:02:02.760
They then cross reference free cash flow coverage ratios above 1.5 times to confirm sustainability.

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:08.800
This tactic has historically performed best in sideways or mildly declining markets

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:15.180
where organic growth slows but cash generation remains strong. The main risk is that management

00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:21.720
overpays for shares or diverts capital from higher return projects. A practical step is to add a

00:02:21.720 --> 00:02:27.400
custom alert in your brokerage screener for share repurchase authorization increases greater than

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:33.920
5% of market cap. Pair that alert with a 50-day moving average filter to avoid catching falling

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:40.680
knives. Imagine you bought an oil services ETF yesterday morning when the latest Hormuz headlines hit.

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:47.640
Your market order filled at the ask but the quoted spread had already widened from 3 cents to 18 cents

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:54.080
within the first 20 minutes of trading. That extra 15 cent gap represents immediate slippage that

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:58.580
compounds on larger position sizes and is rarely visible in end of day charts.

00:02:59.380 --> 00:03:05.120
Market makers widen spreads to protect against adverse selection when news flow spikes volume

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:12.260
without balanced two-way interest. Limit orders placed just inside the widen spread often get ignored

00:03:12.260 --> 00:03:18.800
until the next law. Professionals pre-stage orders during lower volatility periods or use midpoint

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:24.320
peg orders when available. The biggest mistake is assuming your broker's best execution guarantee

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:30.340
protects you from temporary widening. Always check the level 2 book and recent trade prints for the

00:03:30.340 --> 00:03:36.920
prior 15 minutes before entering size on any name showing headline-driven volume. This is a simulated

